# Trinity Lead State Machine

Trinity leads move through a strict evidence-gated lifecycle.

A plausible claim is not a finding. A lead only advances when the evidence for the current state is present, reviewable, and tied to an authorized target.

## States

```text
signal
  -> hypothesis
  -> repro_attempted
  -> reproduced_real
  -> council_accepted
  -> report_ready
